  The draft says the youth 'இளைஞர் இது' is the 23-year-old and 'இவர் ... நடத்துகிறார்', which is fine, but the reel_script and caption say the students 'காத்திருந்தனர்' waiting 'வீட்டுக்கு செல்ல' - article says they were standing to go home after school; acceptable. However, the draft's slides and caption state the students 'கூச்சலிட்டு எச்சரித்தனர்' (shouted and warned), while the article only says the students shouted (கூச்சலிட்டுள்ளனா்), so 'எச்சரித்தனர்' (warned) is an invented detail.
  The caption says the youth 'குன்னத்தூர் பேருந்து நிலையத்தில் சம்பவம் நடத்தினார்' - an ungrammatical/unclear Tamil sentence; the article places the act at the bus stand but the sentence structure 'சம்பவம் நடத்தினார்' is awkward and does not clearly convey the meaning of the incident.
  The reel_script states the arrest was made after the youth was caught by passengers, but it mixes the passengers' handover to the police with the police registering a case under POCSO in one flow, combining two separate steps into one sentence.
